the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 14.

the actions are:
    the move place with *a quadrant*, *an index* and *a second index* is made; known as place.
    the move rotate with *a quadrant* and *a direction* is made; known as rotate.

the fluents are:
    *a quadrant* cellholds *an index* with *a second index* with *a role*; known as cellholds.
    *a role* is a control; known as control.
    *a thing* is a phase; known as phase.
    *a quadrant* cellmarked *an index* with *a second index*; known as cellmarked.
    *a player* is a col; known as col.
    *a player* is a diag; known as diag.
    the move place with *a quadrant*, *an index* and *a second index* is legal; known as legal_place.
    the move rotate with *a quadrant* and *a direction* is legal; known as legal_rotate.
    *a player* is a row; known as row.
    *a quadrant* cellempty *an index* with *a second index*; known as cellempty.
    *a player* is a line; known as line.
    boardopen; known as boardopen.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.

the templates are:
    *a thing* globalindex *an index* with *a second index* with *a mg* with *a ng*.
    *a dir* rotation *a thing* with *a second thing* with *a third thing* with *a fourth thing*.
    *a thing* verticalflip *an index* with *a second thing* with *a second index*.
    *an index* horizontalflip *a thing* with *a second index* with *a second thing*.
    *a quadrant* is quadrant.
    *an index* is an index.
    *a direction* is a direction.
    the succ of *a ng* is *a second ng*.
    *a thing* add *a second thing* with *a ng*.

the knowledge base pentago includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/pentago.hrf".

1 globalindex an index with a second index with the index with the second index if
    the index is an index
    and the second index is an index.

2 globalindex an index with a second index with the index with a ng if
    3 add the second index with the ng
    and the index is an index.

3 globalindex an index with a second index with a mg with a ng if
    3 add the index with the mg
    and 3 add the second index with the ng.

4 globalindex an index with a second index with a mg with the second index if
    3 add the index with the mg
    and the second index is an index.

clockwise rotation a thing with a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the second thing horizontalflip the thing with the third thing with the fourth thing.

counterclockwise rotation a thing with a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the second thing verticalflip the thing with the third thing with the fourth thing.

1 verticalflip an index with 3 with the index if
    the index is an index.

2 verticalflip an index with 2 with the index if
    the index is an index.

3 verticalflip an index with 1 with the index if
    the index is an index.

an index horizontalflip 1 with the index with 3 if
    the index is an index.

an index horizontalflip 2 with the index with 2 if
    the index is an index.

an index horizontalflip 3 with the index with 1 if
    the index is an index.

1 is quadrant.

2 is quadrant.

3 is quadrant.

4 is quadrant.

1 is an index.

2 is an index.

3 is an index.

clockwise is a direction.

counterclockwise is a direction.

the succ of 1 is 2.

the succ of 2 is 3.

the succ of 3 is 4.

the succ of 4 is 5.

the succ of 5 is 6.

3 add 1 with 4.

3 add 2 with 5.

3 add 3 with 6.

the move place with a quadrant, an index and a second index is legal at a time if
    place is a phase at the time
    and the quadrant cellempty the index with the second index at the time.

the move rotate with a quadrant and a direction is legal at a time if
    rotate is a phase at the time
    and the quadrant is quadrant
    and the direction is a direction.

the goal of red is 100 at a time if
    red is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that black is a line at the time.

the goal of red is 50 at a time if
    it is not the case that red is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that black is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that boardopen at the time.

the goal of red is 50 at a time if
    red is a line at the time
    and black is a line at the time.

the goal of red is 0 at a time if
    black is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that red is a line at the time.

the goal of red is 0 at a time if
    it is not the case that red is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that black is a line at the time
    and boardopen at the time.

the goal of black is 100 at a time if
    black is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that red is a line at the time.

the goal of black is 50 at a time if
    it is not the case that red is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that black is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that boardopen at the time.

the goal of black is 50 at a time if
    red is a line at the time
    and black is a line at the time.

the goal of black is 0 at a time if
    red is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that black is a line at the time.

the goal of black is 0 at a time if
    it is not the case that red is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that black is a line at the time
    and boardopen at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    red is a line at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    black is a line at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    it is not the case that boardopen at the time.

a player is a line at a time if
    the player is a row at the time.

a player is a line at a time if
    the player is a col at the time.

a player is a line at a time if
    the player is a diag at the time.

a player is a row at a time if
    a quadrant cellholds an index with a second index with the player at the time
    and the quadrant globalindex the index with the second index with a mg with a ng
    and the succ of the ng is a second ng
    and a thing globalindex a third index with a fourth index with the mg with the second ng
    and the thing cellholds the third index with the fourth index with the player at the time
    and the succ of the second ng is a third ng
    and a second thing globalindex a fifth index with a sixth index with the mg with the third ng
    and the second thing cellholds the fifth index with the sixth index with the player at the time
    and the succ of the third ng is a fourth ng
    and a third thing globalindex a seventh index with a eighth index with the mg with the fourth ng
    and the third thing cellholds the seventh index with the eighth index with the player at the time
    and the succ of the fourth ng is a fifth ng
    and a fourth thing globalindex a ninth index with a n10 index with the mg with the fifth ng
    and the fourth thing cellholds the ninth index with the n10 index with the player at the time.

a player is a col at a time if
    a quadrant cellholds an index with a second index with the player at the time
    and the quadrant globalindex the index with the second index with a mg with a ng
    and the succ of the mg is a second ng
    and a thing globalindex a third index with a fourth index with the second ng with the ng
    and the thing cellholds the third index with the fourth index with the player at the time
    and the succ of the second ng is a third ng
    and a second thing globalindex a fifth index with a sixth index with the third ng with the ng
    and the second thing cellholds the fifth index with the sixth index with the player at the time
    and the succ of the third ng is a fourth ng
    and a third thing globalindex a seventh index with a eighth index with the fourth ng with the ng
    and the third thing cellholds the seventh index with the eighth index with the player at the time
    and the succ of the fourth ng is a fifth ng
    and a fourth thing globalindex a ninth index with a n10 index with the fifth ng with the ng
    and the fourth thing cellholds the ninth index with the n10 index with the player at the time.

a player is a diag at a time if
    a quadrant cellholds an index with a second index with the player at the time
    and the quadrant globalindex the index with the second index with a mg with a ng
    and the succ of the mg is a second ng
    and the succ of the ng is a third ng
    and a thing globalindex a third index with a fourth index with the second ng with the third ng
    and the thing cellholds the third index with the fourth index with the player at the time
    and the succ of the second ng is a fourth ng
    and the succ of the third ng is a fifth ng
    and a second thing globalindex a fifth index with a sixth index with the fourth ng with the fifth ng
    and the second thing cellholds the fifth index with the sixth index with the player at the time
    and the succ of the fourth ng is a sixth ng
    and the succ of the fifth ng is a seventh ng
    and a third thing globalindex a seventh index with a eighth index with the sixth ng with the seventh ng
    and the third thing cellholds the seventh index with the eighth index with the player at the time
    and the succ of the sixth ng is a eighth ng
    and the succ of the seventh ng is a ninth ng
    and a fourth thing globalindex a ninth index with a n10 index with the eighth ng with the ninth ng
    and the fourth thing cellholds the ninth index with the n10 index with the player at the time.

a player is a diag at a time if
    a quadrant cellholds an index with a second index with the player at the time
    and the quadrant globalindex the index with the second index with a mg with a ng
    and the succ of the mg is a second ng
    and the succ of a third ng is the ng
    and a thing globalindex a third index with a fourth index with the second ng with the third ng
    and the thing cellholds the third index with the fourth index with the player at the time
    and the succ of the second ng is a fourth ng
    and the succ of a fifth ng is the third ng
    and a second thing globalindex a fifth index with a sixth index with the fourth ng with the fifth ng
    and the second thing cellholds the fifth index with the sixth index with the player at the time
    and the succ of the fourth ng is a sixth ng
    and the succ of a seventh ng is the fifth ng
    and a third thing globalindex a seventh index with a eighth index with the sixth ng with the seventh ng
    and the third thing cellholds the seventh index with the eighth index with the player at the time
    and the succ of the sixth ng is a eighth ng
    and the succ of a ninth ng is the seventh ng
    and a fourth thing globalindex a ninth index with a n10 index with the eighth ng with the ninth ng
    and the fourth thing cellholds the ninth index with the n10 index with the player at the time.

boardopen at a time if
    a quadrant cellempty an index with a second index at the time.

a quadrant cellempty an index with a second index at a time if
    the quadrant is quadrant
    and the index is an index
    and the second index is an index
    and it is not the case that the quadrant cellmarked the index with the second index at the time.

a quadrant cellmarked an index with a second index at a time if
    the quadrant cellholds the index with the second index with a role at the time.

when the move place with a quadrant, an index and a second index is made
    and a role is a control
then the quadrant cellholds the index with the second index with the role.

when the move place with a quadrant, an index and a second index is made
then rotate is a phase
    and it is not the case that place is a phase.

when the move rotate with a quadrant and a direction is made
    and the quadrant cellholds an index with a second index with a role
    and the direction rotation the index with the second index with a thing with a second thing
then the quadrant cellholds the thing with the second thing with the role
    and it is not the case that the quadrant cellholds the index with the second index with the role.

when the move rotate with a quadrant and a direction is made
then place is a phase
    and it is not the case that rotate is a phase.

when the move rotate with a quadrant and a direction is made
    and red is a control
then black is a control
    and it is not the case that red is a control.

when the move rotate with a quadrant and a direction is made
    and black is a control
then red is a control
    and it is not the case that black is a control.

it must not be true that
    the move place with a quadrant, an index and a second index is made
    and it is not the case that the move place with the quadrant, the index and the second index is legal.

it must not be true that
    the move rotate with a quadrant and a direction is made
    and it is not the case that the move rotate with the quadrant and the direction is legal.

initially place is a phase
    and red is a control.

% EpilogJS's state after the play (the twin's final state under LPS2 must be the same):
%   - control(red)
%   - phase(place)
%   - cellholds(1,3,1,red)
%   - cellholds(2,1,1,black)
%   - cellholds(2,1,2,black)
%   - cellholds(2,3,3,black)
%   - cellholds(4,3,1,red)
%   - cellholds(4,3,2,red)
scenario play is:
    the move place with 1, 1 and 1 is made from 1 to 2.
    the move rotate with 4 and counterclockwise is made from 2 to 3.
    the move place with 2, 3 and 1 is made from 3 to 4.
    the move rotate with 3 and counterclockwise is made from 4 to 5.
    the move place with 4, 2 and 1 is made from 5 to 6.
    the move rotate with 2 and counterclockwise is made from 6 to 7.
    the move place with 2, 1 and 2 is made from 7 to 8.
    the move rotate with 1 and counterclockwise is made from 8 to 9.
    the move place with 4, 1 and 1 is made from 9 to 10.
    the move rotate with 4 and counterclockwise is made from 10 to 11.
    the move place with 2, 1 and 1 is made from 11 to 12.
    the move rotate with 3 and counterclockwise is made from 12 to 13.

